{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object detected, find and take it. Check properties, complete task assigned. Scan area if lost.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInSight    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
